# The build context is uploaded to the daemon on every build, so this file is
# a build-speed control, not tidiness.
#
# A bare ".build/" would match only the repository root. The vendored
# dependency tree lives at Server/.build/checkouts, so the glob has to be
# path-independent or every build ships Hummingbird's whole source tree.
**/.build
DerivedData/
.git
.gitignore

# The server image can never need the app tree or the documentation.
App/
docs/
.vscode/
.github/

**/.DS_Store
**/xcuserdata/
